  "label": "Binary Worldview",
  "description": "The meme promotes a binary worldview that divides people into 'us' (the defiant lion) and 'them' (the mediocre conformists). This is a common rhetorical device in propaganda and political discourse, used to simplify complex social dynamics and foster group identity or superiority. It implicitly references social psychology concepts like in-group/out-group dynamics.",
